      "message": "`rw.reset()` doesn\u0027t clear the rev filter, and `BitmappedReachabilityChecker` leaves its `ReachedFilter` on `rw`. With bitmaps, the walk below stops at the first commit that has a bitmap and doesn\u0027t follow its parents. E.g. stable\u003dI, master\u003dI-a-b after gc: pushing a child of b to refs/for/stable reports only b, not a.\n```suggestion\n              rw.reset();\n              rw.setRevFilter(RevFilter.ALL);\n```",
